{
  "an4.10:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 4.10 ",
  "an4.10:0.2": "1. At Wares Village ",
  "an4.10:0.3": "Yokes ",
  "an4.10:1.1": "“Mendicants, there are these four yokes. ",
  "an4.10:1.2": "What four? ",
  "an4.10:1.3": "The yokes of sensual pleasures, future lives, views, and ignorance. ",
  "an4.10:1.4": "And what is the yoke of sensual pleasures? ",
  "an4.10:1.5": "It’s when you don’t truly understand sensual pleasures’ origin, disappearance, gratification, drawback, and escape. ",
  "an4.10:1.6": "So greed, relishing, affection, infatuation, thirst, passion, attachment, and craving for sensual pleasures linger on inside. ",
  "an4.10:1.7": "This is called the yoke of sensual pleasures. ",
  "an4.10:1.8": "Such is the yoke of sensual pleasures. ",
  "an4.10:2.1": "And what is the yoke of future lives? ",
  "an4.10:2.2": "It’s when you don’t truly understand future lives’ origin, disappearance, gratification, drawback, and escape. ",
  "an4.10:2.3": "So greed, relishing, affection, infatuation, thirst, passion, attachment, and craving for continued existence linger on inside. ",
  "an4.10:2.4": "This is called the yoke of future lives. ",
  "an4.10:2.5": "Such are the yokes of sensual pleasures and future lives. ",
  "an4.10:3.1": "And what is the yoke of views? ",
  "an4.10:3.2": "It’s when you don’t truly understand views’ origin, disappearance, gratification, drawback, and escape. ",
  "an4.10:3.3": "So greed, relishing, affection, infatuation, thirst, passion, attachment, and craving